        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yonasani kūbabūlaga Bafilisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lūmò ū Yonasani ūng'wīla mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe, “Tūkīlage kū nkīlo tūje ū kū ng'hambī ya Bafilisiti īy'ūko;” alīyo atang'wīlile ū ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Saulo walī Miguloni, kūjīlīīla kū lūbīmbī lwa Gibea; walī hamò na banhū gītī magana atandatū gīko, alembeelile mu mbeho ya ntī gw'ikomamanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Ahija walī hamò nabo, walī azwalile ifoodi; ū ng'wenūyo walī ng'witūnja wa nkūūlūye o ng'wa Ikaboodi ng'wana Finehasi, ng'witūnja wa ngabīji Eli. Ū mu bose benabo ndūhū nūūlū ūmò ūyo wal'adeebile gīkī ū Yonasani walī atīho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani nū mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe aho balīja ū kū ng'hambī ya Bafilisiti baabītīla nzīla ya kūbīta ha ng'wanya gūkīngilwe ngegu ndīhu kose kose, ījo jalī na mina, ū lūmò lwitanagwa Bozezi, ū lūngī Senehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūgegu ū lūmò lwalī lwikīgile kū lwandī lwa sukuma, kūjīlīīla Mikimashi; ū lūngī lūbiza dakama kūjīlīīla Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yonasani ūng'wīla ū mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe, “Tūkīlage ū kū nkīlo kwenūko tūje ū kū ng'hambī ya bing'wana abo batasaalilwe abo; hamo ū SEEBA adūgije kūtūlwīlīīla. Nguno shitīho sha kūng'hangīja ū SEEBA ū kūpīja, ībize kūtūmamīla banhū bingī nūūlū bageehu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe ūshosha, “Gwītage dūhū ūyo ūlīnago mu maganiko gako, ū mu būlamuji ūbo ūlaabūfunye ī ng'holò yane nū būpanga wane shilī hamò nang'ho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani ūhaya, “Būgatū numho lūūlū tūlinhage tūkīle twegeele koi tūkiyooleche batūloleele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū būtūwīla gīkī, ‘Bing'we īkī tūmusange ho,’ tūkwikala aho tūlaabize henaho; yaya ū kūja koi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū būhaya, ‘Egeelegi aha;’ a henaho tūkūlinha tūje koi, nguno ū lwenūlo lūkūbiza lūmeng'ho lwa koolecha gīkī ū SEEBA wabatūūlaga mu makono gise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana būbīlī wabo biyoolecha ū kū ng'hambī ya Bafilisiti. A Bafilisiti biwīla, “Alibalolagi a Bahebulania, bandya kūpuluka ū mu myoobo ūmo baalī biibisaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banhū abo baalī a ha ng'hambī yenīyo būbahamukīla a ba Yonasani nū mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe balībawīla, “Al'egeelagi aha tūng'oolekeje īlo lyamponola baayega!” Hūna ū Yonasani ūng'wīla ū mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe, “Tūlinhage ūnikūūbīje, nguno ū SEEBA wabatūūlaga mu makono ga Baisilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani ūlinha akūshimīzīlaga mazwi na makono, nū mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe alī a hanuma yaakwe. Hūna ū Yonasani wandya kūyūbasendeka ūmò ūmò a Bafilisiti, ū mūcha wa shilanga shakwe wiza wayūbamalīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza ī liguhī lyenīlo ū Yonasani nū mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe būbūlaga bagosha makūmi abīlī, h'itogolo lya būtaale wa kwegeela ha nusu ya heka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī libità ī lyose lyūgwīlwa idetemya pye hose hose, abo baalī ū mu ng'hambī, na a babo baalī kū masaka, na a babo bajaga bakūdimaga shikolo sha kūlekwa kūlwa kūpeela būlūgū. Yūtingina ī sī, yūgwīlwa lyogohya itaale no!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpyeenwa kwa Bafilisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba ng'wa Saulo abo baalī Gibea ya Benjamini, abo baalī na nīmo gwa kūbūlola ū būlūgū ūmo būkūjīlaga, aho baaponya a miso būbona gīkī a bashilikale bandya kūpeela sagala bakūsalang'hanaga hose hose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saulo ūbawīla a banhū abo walī hamò nabo, “Babalagi a banhū tūdeebe nani atīho a henaha.” Baahayūbabala, būbona gīkī walī atīho Yonasani na mūūcha wa shilanga shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūng'wīla gīkī ū Ahija, “Lyenhage aha ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu.” (Nguno ī likanza lyenīlo a Baisilaeli baalī balījana ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho ataalī ūyomba nū ngabīji, yongeja kūkwīla ī yoge ū kū ng'hambī ya Bafilisiti. Haho na haho hangī ūng'wīla ū ngabīji, “Īnjaga ho ū nkono gwako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saulo na a banhū bakwe bikuminga pye a bose kūja kū būlūgū, būbasanga a Bafilisiti baazwanganaga kībi no, baabizagisengagūla shū boi bike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahebulania balebe baalī hamò na a Bafilisiti kūfuma makanza ga kū numa, baalī baja hamò nabo nū kū ng'hambī yabo; ī likanza lyenīlo a benabo būgalūka bisangīja na a Baisilaeli abo baalī hamò na Saulo na Yonasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a Baisilaeli abo baalī bibisa kū sī ja magūlya ga Efulaimu aho bigwa gīkī a Bafilisiti balīpeela, nabo būgulumūka būkūūbīja bakūbapeejaga a Bafilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lūshikū lwenūlo ū SEEBA ūbapīja a Baisilaeli, ū būlūgū būhūūma būjile, būūkakīlaanhya nī Beeti-aveni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yonasani kūlya malela ga būūkī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū lūshikū lwenūlo a Baisilaeli baalī na makoye no, nguno ū Saulo walī wabalemeja a banhū ū kūlya; ūbilahīja alīhaya, “Ni azumagwe ūyo alaalye shilīwa shose shose ī lelo aho lītaalī kūgwa ī līīmi, aho nataalī kūbamalīla shiilī a banishi baane!” Ng'hana atigelile munhū ose ose wa kūloja shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī libità lya bashilikale lyūshilīla ū ng'wipoolu; al'ū būūkī, walī wingī no wamodagūkaga hasī dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho baashika ū ng'wipoolu, batagimile kūbūkuumya ū būūkī, gīkī hīmba babūtūūle kū nomo nūūlū īkī baabūbonaga; nguno baalī bogoha izumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani ū ng'wene walī atigwile ī gīkī ū ise walī wabalemeja a banhū ūbilahīja na kūbilahīja. Na lūūlū ūkīnda malela na nang'ha walī nago mu nkono, ūgasola ūgatūūla mu nomo, aho walya ūbbalamuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ūmò wa bashilikale wang'wīla, “Bebe ū namhala",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ū namhala:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū ū so.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wabalemejaga gete a banhū nīyo ūbilahīja na kūbilahīja alīhaya, ‘Ni azumagwe ūyo alaalye shilīwa shose shose ī lelo!’ H'ī nguno yene a banhū baseedeekaga gīkī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonasani nang'hwe ūhaya, “Ū baba watūtūūlaga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Watūtūūlaga mu makoye:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, wītūūlaga mu makoyī ī sī.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mu makoye mataale no, ī gīsī angū mulībona ū nene ūmo naabbalamukīla ī haha alīyo naaloja tūūbūūkī tūdoololo dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ītī chiza no a banhū ūlū ni baalyaaga shimò na shimò ū kūfuma ū mu shikolo īsho baadimaga kwīnga kū banishi babo ī lelo? Ni batabūlagilwe no a Bafilisiti?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo a Baisilaeli bakaseedeeka no, nguno bakababūlaga no a Bafilisiti, kūfuma Mikimashi kūja Aijaloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bandya kūjisakamīla ī mitugo ījo baalī baajidima mu būlūgū, ng'holo, ng'ombe būyaga na ndama; būyūjisīnza sagala dūhū hose hose baajilya na mininga gajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū ūmò ūng'wīla ū Saulo, “Baba ntemi, a banhū balīta yabūbi kūlī SEEBA, nguno balīlya nyama na mininga gajo.” Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Mulīhūba ī gīko; alipilingityagi iwe munenhele aha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saulo ūhaya, “Salang'hanagi muje mukūbawīlaga a banhū gīkī, ‘Būlī ūmò wing'we ni eenhage aha ī ng'ombe yakwe nī ng'holo, ng'wize mujisīnzīle aha mulye. Mutang'hūbagi gīko ū SEEBA kūlwa kūlya nyama na mininga gajo.’” Hūna ī mhīndī yenīyo būlī munhū wenha ng'ombe yakwe wīsīnzīla henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūbeeja ng'walīlo kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA; lwalī lūkangala lwakwe lwa kwandya ū kūbeeja ng'walīlo kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yonasani kūgunanhwa na banhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī likanza lyenīlo ū Saulo ūhaya, “Tūjagi ū kū Bafilisiti ī būjikū yenīyī tūkadiime nding'wa kūshisha wele, nīyo tūtizūneka nūūlū ūmò wabo alī mpanga.” A banhū būnshokeja balīhaya, “Ītaga dūhū gīt'ūmo ūlībonela.” Alīyo ū ngabīji ūhaya, “Tūmūjagi tame ū Mulungu aha tūlī henaha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saulo ūmūūja ū Mulungu, “Nabakūūbīje a Bafilisiti? Ūkūbatūūla ū mu makono ga Baisilaeli?” Alīyo ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū Mulungu atanshokegije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Saulo ūhaya, “Bing'we a batongeeji ba mabità, egeelagi aha tūgūlole ū mhayo gwenūyū, tūbone būbi kī wītagwa ī lelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīng'wilahīlīla kūlī SEEBA mpanga, ū mpīja wa Baisilaeli; gīkī ū būhūbi wene nūūlū būlaabize wītagwa na Yonasani ū ng'witūnja wane, akūcha.” Alīyo atilongile munhū nūūlū ūmò wa kūnshokeja mhayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Saulo ūbawīla a banhū, “A bing'we īmīīlagi aho, ū nene nū ng'witūnja wane ū Yonasani twīmīīle aha.” A banhū būng'wīla hangī, “Ītaga īyo ūlībona īlībeelela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saulo ūnomba ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Baisilaeli; ūhaya, “Oolechaga mu būtūngīlīja.” Yūūbagwīla ī mbale ū Yonasani nū Saulo; a banhū būpīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūhaya, “Alitūtūlīgījage ī mbale ū nene nū ng'witūnja wane ū Yonasani,” ūsolwa ū Yonasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Saulo ūng'wīla ū Yonasani, “Niwīlage īyo wīyītaga.” Ū Yonasani ūhaya, “Naalī naakīnda kalela ka būūkī na nang'ha gwane nūūkalya; na lūūlū ūlū kūcha ni nachaage, ūūyū nalīho aha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo wilahīla alīhaya, “Ū Mulungu ni anitūlage habbahu na kūtinda ho, ūlū ūtachiile Yonasani!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū būhaya, “Ū Yonasani ache gete, ū munhū ūyo wabeejaga mhayo gwa būtindi būtaale gīkī mu Isilaeli? Ū gwenūyo gūtūūdūlīkana nūūlū hado! Tūlīkwilahīlīla kūlī SEEBA mpanga gīkī, lūtūūgwaaga hasī nūūlū lūywīlī lūmò lwa kū ntwe gwakwe, nguno ū mhayo gwenūyū wagwītaga ī lelo mu kūgunanhwa na Mulungu.” A banhū būbiza banguna ū Yonasani, ūpīla ū kūbūlagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Saulo ūleka nū kūbakūūbīja a Bafilisiti, būshoka kū sī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo aho alī ntemi wa Baisilaeli, walī na wilwisha na a banishi babo bose abo baalī babapīndije hose hose, Bamoabu, Baamoni, Baedomu, batemi ba Zoba, na a Bafilisiti. Būlī bene ūlū wabagalūkīla wabapyenaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a Baamaleki akalwa nabo nyagosha ūbapyeena, ūbiza wabapīja a Baisilaeli kūfuma mu makono ga banhū abo baalī baabakenaagūja sī yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaya ya ng'wa Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Saulo baalī ba Yonasani, Ishivi na Malikishua; ū nshīke wakwe ū ntaale walī Melabu, ū ndo Mikali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nke wakwe ī lina lyakwe walī Ahinoamu, nshīke o ng'wa Ahimaazi. Ī lina lya ntaale wa mabità ga bashilikale ba ng'wa Saulo walī Abuneeli, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Neeli; ū Neeli ng'wenūyo walī ise ndo o ng'wa Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise o ng'wa Saulo ū Kishi, nū Neeli ū ise o ng'wa Abuneeli baalī bitūnja ba ng'wa Abieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jose ja būlamu bo ng'wa Saulo walīho būlūgū wabūbi no a ha gatī yakwe na a Bafilisiti. Na lūūlū ū Saulo wabizaga ūlū wamona būlī munhū wa nguzu nūūlū nshisha ng'holò, wansolaga wantūūla kūbiza ntūmami wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
